Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?The=20lower=20screen=20as=20a=20menu=20while=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?the=20Pok=C3=A9tch=20is=20up=20(SDK=5FPORT=5F3DS)?=
